https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.5.beta4\n- not reproducible in: Godot 4.5.dev5\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.5.beta4 - Compatibility Renderer - WebXR -Quest\n\n### Issue description\n\n```get_playback_position()``` return incorrect values in my WebXR Fitness app. I encountered this issue in version 4.5.beta4. In the last working WebXR version, 4.5.dev5, the bug never occurred (with the same code). Sometimes the deviations are 10 or 20 seconds. So, the song is just starting (you can hear it) and get_playback_position() returns 10.40xxx. I've taken a screenshot of this. \n![godot_bug_get_playback_position](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04b96c5a-02c0-43bc-ab9f-5946a07cd6ed). \nMaybe this is the reason: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948. The error probably only occurs with ```playback_type = sample``` (which is the default value in the project settings for web projects). So, the error is so obvious that it should have been noticed during testing. So, it might be a different bug fix than this one. I just couldn't find any other thread besides this one.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nTo reproduce this, you should load a song and play it for a few seconds. Then load the same or another one and play it again, and then the bug occurs. Something like that:\n\n```\naspSong.stream = ResourceLoader.load(path) # ogg- file\naspSong.play() # play some seconds then \naspSong.stop()\nawait get_tree().create_timer(10).timeout\naspSong.stream = ResourceLoader.load(path) # ogg- file\naspSong.play() \n```\nthen check ```get_playback_position()``` in ```func _process```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nwatch steps to produce","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109144/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}